+ * The controller was identified from its register sequence, not from a
+ * datasheet or a marking: the sequence opens with the GC9703 command-set
+ * enable (0xd7 0x61 0x74 0x97) and uses that controller's page select
+ * (0xd0) and register layout.
+ */
